---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

// The live Masterclass is paused. Its full page is preserved, unrouted, at
// src/pages/_masterclass.astro — rename it back to masterclass.astro (and
// remove this file) to reintroduce it.
const FREE_URL = 'https://www.bedrockprep.com/problems';
---

<Layout
  title="Masterclass"
  minimal
  description="The SAT Math Masterclass curriculum has moved to Bedrock, an interactive SAT Math platform used by over 65,000 students."
>
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 pt-10 pb-16 sm:pt-12 sm:pb-24">
    <h1 class="reveal font-sans font-black tracking-tight text-ink text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-[1.15]">
      The Masterclass curriculum has moved to my platform,
      <a
        href="https://www.bedrockprep.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap align-bottom hover:text-coral transition-colors"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          viewBox="0 0 96 96"
          fill="none"
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="h-[1.15em] w-[1.15em]"
        >
          <g stroke="#141414" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M80 30 L86 56 L70 82 L32 84 L46 48 Z" fill="#C63C1E" stroke-width="3" />
            <path d="M18 32 L46 48 L32 84 L12 58 Z" fill="#EE4E29" stroke-width="3" />
            <path d="M18 32 L36 16 L58 12 L80 30 L46 48 Z" fill="#FFE0CB" stroke-width="3" />
            <path d="M36 16 L58 12 L80 30 L86 56 L70 82 L32 84 L12 58 L18 32 Z" fill="none" stroke-width="3.5" />
          </g>
        </svg>
        Bedrock
      </a>
    </h1>

    <div class="reveal mt-6 space-y-5 font-sans text-lg sm:text-xl text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I&rsquo;m not teaching live classes right now. Instead, I&rsquo;ve turned the Masterclass curriculum into
        Bedrock, an interactive online platform used by over <span class="text-coral font-bold">65,000 students</span>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Unlike most SAT prep platforms, Bedrock is built <b class="text-ink">specifically for SAT Math</b>. It
        takes you through a structured curriculum of practice problems, video lessons, Desmos tricks, and realistic
        exams to <b class="text-ink">overprepare</b> you for test day.
      </p>
      <p>
        My own students have used Bedrock over the past few weeks to earn 790s and 800s. It&rsquo;s
        everything from the Masterclass at a fraction of the price, and you can start for free.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
      <img
        src="/formal.png"
        alt="Eric"
        class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full border-2 border-ink object-cover object-[50%_30%]"
      />
      <span class="font-sans text-xl font-bold text-ink">&ndash; Eric</span>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-8 flex justify-center">
      <a
        href={FREE_URL}
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-coral text-white font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded-full border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-sm hover:shadow-none hover:translate-x-[3px] hover:translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-200 text-lg"
      >
        Get Started for Free &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
